  "query": "Help me understand how smartphones and social media are rewiring our brains and changing human consciousness through a comprehensive analysis. Focus on two groups: adolescents and adults. I want to analyze (1) what neuroscience tells us about how constant connectivity affects attention, memory, and emotional regulation across different developmental stages, (2) how these technological changes might be altering fundamental aspects of human experience like solitude, boredom, and deep thinking, (3) whether we're losing cognitive abilities that took millennia to develop and what the implications are for human development. You should only focus on studies from the past 5 years ."
